WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.542 --> 00:00:07.199
Are your expenses already in an Excel workbook? Import it into a project dossier.

2
00:00:07.199 --> 00:00:14.961
Choose the project, then the dossier that will receive the lines.

3
00:00:14.961 --> 00:00:19.215
Choose the workbook.

4
00:00:19.215 --> 00:00:28.893
Simulate first (“Simulate the import”): nothing is written, you see what would be created.

5
00:00:28.893 --> 00:00:36.819
Everything is correct: turn off the simulation, then click “Import”.

6
00:00:36.819 --> 00:00:44.130
The lines arrive as drafts in the dossier. Then attach each one's document.
